      "id": "doc-615b2b6d8a1fd2f64a8c6a",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "开局上阵：苏烈、李元芳、干将，走连胜。把阿离的伞给干将打工，升级前可以补个弈星。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-a9140a94d5b9dbe6580c87aa00f2679808a404499bbd2aaa1c15d58a31c1f9e7",
